+- Resume reads a named id with one call per attempt, the store's `lookup` when it has one and its `get` otherwise, and either way resumes a live session and answers a dead id `unknown` ([validated by: reads a named id with one call per attempt: lookup when the store has it, get otherwise](../../src/transport/sessionResume.test.ts#L546)).
 
